\fs24 \cf0 Problem:
\f1\b0  ~50,000 packages discovered via deps.dev/SBOMs have PURLs but no CPE match in NVD. Without CPE linkage, NVD vulnerability data can't reach these packages through the graph.\

\f0\b Gap Detection Query:
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f5\fs26 \cf0 FOR c IN components\
    LET has_cpe = LENGTH(\
        FOR e IN matched_by_cpe\
            FILTER e._from == CONCAT("components/", c._key)\
            RETURN 1\
    ) > 0\
    FILTER !has_cpe\
    RETURN \{\
        _key: c._key,\
        purl: c.purl,\
        name: c.name,\
        ecosystem: c.ecosystem,\
        version: c.version,\
        homepage: c.homepage,\
        source_repo: c.source_repo\
    \}\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

